  "description": "Identifies trading sessions indicative of layering or spoofing tactics.",
  "definition": "A transaction record suggests Layering/Spoofing if its layering indicator is 'Confirmed' OR (its spoofing probability > 0.75 AND 'Order Modification Intensity' > 1.0)."
}

