  "description": "Identifies compliance cases under intense review or investigation.",
  "definition": "A case is under Elevated Regulatory Scrutiny if its alert level is 'High' or 'Critical' AND its investigation priority is 'High' AND its monitoring intensity is 'Intensive'."
}

