  "description": "Explains the nature of dark pool usage indicated in transaction records.",
  "definition": "Dark pools are private exchanges (e.g., Alternative Trading Systems) used for large orders to reduce market impact. Usage patterns can be analyzed for regulatory compliance or signs of avoiding market transparency."
}

